
title: ShelfStart
---
<<declare $shelfPhase = "">>
<<setShelfPhase ShelfNPC>>

<<if $shelfPhase == "start">>
    <<jump ShelfAsk>>
<<elseif $shelfPhase == "quest_complete_return">>
    <<jump ShelfDone>>
<<else>>
    <<jump ShelfAsk>>
<<endif>>
===

title: ShelfAsk
---
NPC: Hey there, can you help me with something?
NPC: I've been trying to move this shelf.
NPC: It's too heavy for me to move alone.
NPC: Can you help me push it?

-> Yes, I can help.
    <<jump ShelfYes>>
-> Maybe later.
    <<jump ShelfLater>>
===

title: ShelfYes
---
Sagunn: Sure, let's move it.
NPC: Alright, let's push!

<<moveShelf ShelfNPC>>

NPC: Nice! We finally moved it.
NPC: Thanks for helping me.

<<getShelfPhase ShelfNPC "quest_complete_return">>
===

title: ShelfLater
---
Sagunn: Not right now.
NPC: Alright, come back when you're ready.
===

title: ShelfDone
---
NPC: Hey, thanks again for helping me move that shelf.
===
